            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows XP<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 2 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Integrated graphics is fine, or really any wire &amp; tin foil you can cobble together that looks like a GPU.<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 200 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> If you don't have one, just make beep &amp; boop noises with your mouth when appropriate.<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> You can probably get this to run on a toaster.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Core i5/i7 processor (Fast CPUs allow lighting to render)<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 200 MB de espaço livre</li></ul>"
            },
